* Speedometer updates smoothly.
* Progress is based on actual test duration.
* Countdown is visible but secondary.
* Do not visually fake the speed value.

---

# PHASE 10 — Upload Test UI

When download completes, transition cleanly to upload.

```text id="wdm1o1"
UPLOAD SPEED

       48.21
        Mbps

Testing...

████████░░░░

Time remaining: 3s
```

### Requirements

* Reset the speedometer appropriately.
* Update using real upload measurements.
* Run for approximately 7 seconds.
* Maintain consistent UI with download testing.

