# PHASE 11 — Ping and Latency UI

Ping should be measured before download/upload.

Display it simply:

```text id="9bfukm"
PING

12 ms
```

Once measured, keep it available during the remaining test.

Avoid giving ping more visual importance than download/upload speed.

---

# PHASE 12 — Live Metrics Design

During testing:

```text id="qfc98a"
Ping
12 ms

Download
245 Mbps

Upload
Testing...
```

### Rules

* Measured values appear when available.
* Future metrics show `Testing...`.
* Do not show fake `0 Mbps` values.
* Completed metrics remain visible.
* Current metric receives visual emphasis.

